      </AsciiMap>

      <p>Head west two screens and you&#x27;ll see a path below you. Slowly take a step down and swing your sword periodically, hoping to reveal a hidden trap that would have otherwise damaged everyone. At the bottom is a chest which contains <Tag type="weapon">Sniper Rounds</Tag> (ATK+20/MAG+3) that you can sell. Push the nearby barrel around the winding path to the left and down to blow away the rocks blocking a chest which contains <Tag type="item">3 Herbal Teas</Tag>. In the cave above is a chest which contains <Tag type="item">2 Power Down Plus</Tag>.</p>

      <p>Return to the entrance at <Tag type="place">Old Spring East</Tag> and take the north exit this time. Simply go straight north to reach the exit to the <Tag type="place">Sand Fortress</Tag>. You should rest up back at <Tag type="place">Alistel</Tag> before continuing to the Sand Fortress.</p>
    </div>
